  "title": "NASA Celebrates International Observe the Moon Night",
  "summary": "NASA hosts an international celebration to observe the Moon, celebrating its science and significance as part of the Artemis II mission. The event will take place on Saturday, Sept. 19, at NASA's Marshall Space Flight Center in Huntsville, Alabama.",
